{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0AFL", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:792fba653e2a6d83c3af7e313f8883aa3d6e9fffe6496118d1ccb3be2cc43f7a", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe can use the lemma above to make the following definition.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:21b018c4568bb81691fd8b158b55ee0be11ee9a53ec27d637f0fcd1f64e6409a", "unit_id": "tag:0AFL:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0AFL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$x \\in |\\mathcal{X}|$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$[U/R] \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$U$", "MATH_0007": "$u \\in U$", "MATH_0008": "$x$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0010": "$x$", "MATH_0011": "$\\dim_x(\\mathcal{X}) \\in \\mathbf{Z} \\cup \\infty$", "MATH_0012": "$$\n\\dim_x(\\mathcal{X}) = \\dim_u(U)-\\dim_{e(u)}(R_u).\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{algebraic-definition-presentation}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-dimension-at-point-well-defined}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-dimension-at-point}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:08c6b53a20841ca253cab090ee24a6ad2214dd053cf92cb5149e40233acb58e9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0b32ccef3765cb2c8daf5557947863be4d2560f0c57a67e03136319664e9044c", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a locally Noetherian algebraic stack over a scheme <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a point of <MATH_0004>.\nLet <MATH_0005> be a presentation\n(Algebraic Stacks, Definition <REF_0001>)\nwhere <MATH_0006> is a scheme\nand let <MATH_0007> be a point that maps to <MATH_0008>.\nWe define the <TEXTITOPEN_0001>dimension of <MATH_0009> at <MATH_0010><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> to be\nthe element <MATH_0011>\nsuch that \n<MATH_0012>\nwith notation as in Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:69ac8ece570aaf5894988f4d12d8f79cd543f8f6744f60b92ee9f79b20ea8813", "unit_id": "tag:0AFN:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0AFL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{topology-definition-Krull}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-properties-definition-dimension-at-point}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4358773e0f726710a6901d3f9bc82528765c2521d1b82474222fb40757ece4db", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:80af9c9145967e416961ffe815691bfbac6374151104534e36799afb10fd880e", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe dimension of a stack at a point agrees with the usual notion\nwhen <MATH_0001> is a scheme (Topology, Definition\n<REF_0001>),\nor more generally when <MATH_0002> is a locally Noetherian algebraic space\n(Properties of Spaces, Definition\n<REF_0002>).\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6f4456e6eeed557c37bef63f8f7725a08b362e8cf44bc29b6d38a8cf0b347bbc", "unit_id": "tag:0AFL:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0AFL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$\\dim(\\mathcal{X})$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\dim(\\mathcal{X}) = \\sup\\nolimits_{x \\in |\\mathcal{X}|} \\dim_x(\\mathcal{X})\n$$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-dimension}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ec221c4a0b5b771c338ea5ee881067c770910569a71ce167ee4d5b589c80d792", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:85a795d07216ceabe1e7528c1c33864e3cdf431dbbb800379c79d43934289652", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be\na locally Noetherian algebraic stack over <MATH_0003>.\nThe <TEXTITOPEN_0001>dimension<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> <MATH_0004> of <MATH_0005> is defined to be\n<MATH_0006>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:34866a8e17b22cf8db06c13009b428745b678bfe1d904453e48cf1b6cb319ee6", "unit_id": "tag:0AFP:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0AFL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{properties-lemma-dimension}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-properties-definition-dimension}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0002d42c2adc9172acb55958a77085974084083df107126b40344a331769e8cc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6571cb5283bbe43e5f41ca0219d8cbfcc740d7c84138869492ac621110111fa3", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThis definition of dimension agrees with the usual notion\nif <MATH_0001> is a scheme\n(Properties, Lemma <REF_0001>)\nor an algebraic space (Properties of Spaces, Definition\n<REF_0002>).\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:47af0d5bb6f6c83c7fc5228ff94a0c5d0617ffde0cb961668a137491c23cae52", "unit_id": "tag:0AFL:prose-0004"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "0AFL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\dim(\\mathcal{X})$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\dim(\\mathcal{X})$", "MATH_0005": "$Z\\cup \\{\\pm \\infty\\}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\dim(\\mathcal{X}) = -\\infty$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{X}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-dimension-empty-stack}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:987e447a141189a7906474cbd2637bad18d60b6a6a2342dcd00f47978cbf9f07", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:33ebcc4b05f4cd904df676b25968e590077ae4eb1107950a7e0c1c5f0d6a93ef", "source_text": "If <MATH_0001> is a nonempty stack of finite type over a field,\nthen <MATH_0002> is an integer. For an arbitrary\nlocally Noetherian algebraic stack <MATH_0003>,\n<MATH_0004> is in <MATH_0005>,\nand <MATH_0006> if and only if <MATH_0007>\nis empty.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b40885a7c0dc6dc3000940ae58b37e93e8411c6fcd9f1773dd4b952489b184ae", "unit_id": "tag:0AFQ:statement"}
